#items(((runs: ((emph: "bold", text: "Mammoth Attacks:"), (emph: "", text: " When the Ice Mammoth attacks, roll on the appropriate following table to determine its action. If no suitable target is in base contact, roll again on the chart until you get another result.")), sub: ()),))
#para(((emph: "bold", text: "MAN-SIZED THINGS CHART "), (emph: "italic", text: "Use this chart when fighting Infantry, Cavalry, War Beasts or Swarms. "), (emph: "bold", text: "D6 Attack Type 1-2"), (emph: "", text: " Trample "), (emph: "bold", text: "3-4"), (emph: "", text: " Stomp "), (emph: "bold", text: "5"), (emph: "", text: " Bellow "), (emph: "bold", text: "6"), (emph: "", text: " Pick up and...")))
#para(((emph: "bold", text: "BIG THINGS CHART "), (emph: "italic", text: "Use this chart when fighting Monsters, Monstrous Creatures, Monstrous Beasts, Monstrous Infantry, Monstrous Cavalry, Chariots, War Machines, and Shrines. "), (emph: "bold", text: "D6 Attack Type 1-2"), (emph: "", text: " Butt "), (emph: "bold", text: "3-5"), (emph: "", text: " Gore "), (emph: "bold", text: "6"), (emph: "", text: " Bellow")))
#para(((emph: "", text: "- "), (emph: "bold", text: "Trample:"), (emph: "", text: " A single enemy unit in base contact suffers D6 Strength 7 hits, plus an additional D3 Hits for each rank of five or more models it has. - "), (emph: "bold", text: "Bellow:"), (emph: "", text: " Neither the Mammoth nor any unit in contact with it fight if they have not already done so this turn. The Mammoth automatically wins the combat by a minimum of 3 points. This result has no effect against Animated Constructs. - "), (emph: "bold", text: "Butt:"), (emph: "", text: " The Mammoth inflicts D3 Strength 7 automatic Hits with the Multiple Wounds (D3) special rule against one model in base contact (your choice). - "), (emph: "bold", text: "Stomp:"), (emph: "", text: " The Mammoth has the Stomp (2D6) special rule this turn. - "), (emph: "bold", text: "Gore:"), (emph: "", text: " The Mammoth makes 2D6 attacks against a chosen unit in close combat with the Heroic Killing Blow special rule. - "), (emph: "bold", text: "Pick up and...:"), (emph: "", text: " The Mammoth grabs a Character from the target unit (Mammoth player's choice). Roll a D6 to see what unfortunate fate befalls the victim.")))
#para(((emph: "bold", text: "D6 Result 1-2 Throw Back into Combat:"), (emph: "", text: " The victim suffers D3 Strength 6 Hits which Ignores Armour saves, and D6 Strength 3 hits are inflicted on their unit (save as normal). "), (emph: "bold", text: "3-4 Hurl:"), (emph: "", text: " The victim is hurled into an enemy unit within 12\" of the Mammoth – randomly determine which. The victim is removed as a casualty, and the unit takes D6 Strength 3 hits. Unsaved Wounds from these hits count towards the Mammoth's combat result. "), (emph: "bold", text: "5 Eat:"), (emph: "", text: " The victim model is removed as a casualty, and the Mammoth may immediately recover a single Wound it has lost previously in the game. "), (emph: "bold", text: "6 Squash and Grab Another:"), (emph: "", text: " The model is removed as a casualty and the Mammoth then picks another victim. Roll again on this table to see what happens.")))
